cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "En-Masse: Enabling Multi-Agent Synchronization-Space Exploration"
abstract: >-
  A framework for exploring synchronization policies for multi-agent LLM
  execution, from conservative to optimistic. The current release is a
  prototype simulation engine with six policies and a policy-independent
  checker of causality and commit safety.
authors:
